      "count_explanation": "The counts differ because CPC ONI is the official 3-month running mean of CPC's own ERSSTv5 Nino 3.4 anomaly product, computed with CPC's base-period and processing choices. RECON_9120 is rebuilt here from raw ERSSTv5 SST using an area-weighted average over 5S-5N, 170W-120W and a fixed 1991-2020 monthly climatology. Even under the same +0.5 degC and 5-season rule, small differences in base period, spatial averaging, and monthly anomaly construction can move a marginal event across the threshold or change its duration.",
